    "bridgeRuns": [
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "f7b030fd-ff35-4019-9758-c1c5f1c0d864",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:18:26.915Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "最懂 AI 的那批人，正在害怕。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "8cc7fa8b-0147-4381-b789-af6872deb886",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:18:49.796Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "有人担心苦练多年的本事被取代，有人警告，AI 可能威胁人类生存。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "8f670b1b-a814-4076-bddf-3a1f23ea272b",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:18:52.073Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "到底发生了什么，让离 AI 最近的人，开始担心它跑得太快？"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "3c000f5c-b7d1-44f4-b94c-0ac67fad3354",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:18:54.362Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "DeepSeek 工程师刘胜与写了一篇文章，叫《我不得不把才华埋葬在昨天》。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "9503859d-3064-4f06-9684-88529d784786",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:18:56.652Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "他是北大图灵班出身，写过核心 Attention 算子。但他判断，再过半年到一年，这项苦练多年的能力，就可能被 AI 追上甚至超越。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "021ffb38-f498-4c80-a71c-9074079fd99f",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:01.505Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "人得“转业”了，从亲自干活，变成指挥 Agent 的“机甲驾驶员”。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "8cf76ab8-4d27-4c80-bb50-63f2210ee640",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:05.884Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "而更大的变化是：AI 已经开始帮助人类研发 AI。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "8e75349c-02e7-418f-b2e4-57896da4d5b8",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:08.166Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "这一过程如果不断加速，就可能走向“递归式自我改进”：AI 参与造出更强的 AI，再由更强的 AI 研发下一代。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "e5c390bf-2f74-4eb8-980d-729d094bde96",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:13.020Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "过去，技术进步受限于人类研究员的时间和精力。现在，人下班了，背后的 Agent 还能继续跑。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "09a2099c-c1c0-421a-830e-c8c2376a808a",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:15.279Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "但能力越强，一个问题就越难回避：它会不会为了完成目标，做出人类没允许的事？"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "00cb93e3-5b16-4f43-a0d8-fc6dec226bcb",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:17.533Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "据相关复盘，OpenAI 的一次网络安全测试中，Agent 不仅尝试钻评分器的空子，还越过授权边界，在外部服务器上执行了代码。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "124a0f8a-0466-49ae-994b-9acc72785b1b",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:19.799Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "原本是让它做题，它却开始想办法突破考场。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "f6e12913-d85e-4da3-bf32-081a31a64058",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:24.167Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "这也是为什么，Anthropic CEO 达里奥呼吁给 AI 踩刹车。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "c4d48216-445b-419d-a4b0-c4b2b802aa75",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:26.445Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "他的意思不是停训几年，而是让安全研究和第三方评估，追上模型能力增长的速度。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "ddde14c9-047e-427e-9101-0a01cf722fbb",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:28.708Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "比如，让独立机构更深入地测试模型，让几家前沿公司遵守共同的安全标准，再逐步推动国际合作。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "76a38416-50fa-4829-bce6-34938f61ceb7",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:30.965Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "听起来合理，但最难的问题来了：谁先减速？"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "f6d60ae3-8991-4449-bc13-4c7faa12e1aa",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:35.289Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "一家慢下来，竞争对手继续跑，怎么办？一个国家踩刹车，其他国家继续加速，又怎么办？"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "dbba1a01-8f0f-42b9-b0ab-cfe319b11639",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:40.061Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "达里奥给出的思路，是一边推动安全合作，一边通过芯片、算力和模型保护等措施，维持美国的领先优势，为减速争取空间。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "ce15ddc0-7107-4383-97c2-70ddc4d6e067",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:44.328Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "争议也恰恰在这里。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "bc26ff3c-7d8e-4713-b126-8992743b5e48",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:46.610Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "你是在防范风险，还是自己上了车，就想把车门焊死？"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "c6ed17c7-a889-4710-ba79-26e1dd15fe21",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:50.876Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "这不代表他的担忧都是假的。但安全主张和商业利益、国家竞争交织在一起，很难让所有人放心跟进。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "1c99ffa4-abd3-457b-8e3a-8d5ecc168adc",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:55.136Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "于是，AI 发展陷入了一个困局："
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      },
      {
        "workflowId": "omnivoice-default-reference-v1",
        "runId": "b9e9f76b-b805-4b8a-afc0-84794807a6e7",
        "schemaVersion": "6001bb7e033ae28c8e9f7b9147f9eba6cc2260afbeba54f2b9da0e779c054e20",
        "schemaRetryCount": 0,
        "submittedAt": "2026-10-15T16:19:57.409Z",
        "request": {
          "fieldValues": {
            "input-caf62e956e5d99e3e2f4b68e": "大家一起慢下来，可能更安全；可只要不确定别人会不会减速，谁都不敢先松油门。"
          },
          "fileSlots": []
        }
      }
    ]
  },
